---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Last updated: June 2026. Rules and guidelines for our portal."
>
  <div class="space-y-6 text-stone-600 font-normal leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
    <p>
      Welcome to Premier Properties. These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of Premier Properties' Website, located at properties.example.com.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing this website, we assume you accept these terms and conditions. Do not continue to use Premier Properties if you do not agree to take all of the terms and conditions stated on this page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">2. Listing Accuracy and Availability</h2>
    <p>
      While we make every effort to ensure the accuracy, completeness, and availability of the property listings displayed on this portal, all quotes, dimensions, images, and legal statuses are subject to change. They do not constitute a formal, binding contract until a final sale agreement or lease deed is signed by both parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">3. Direct Agent Relationship</h2>
    <p>
      This website is operated by a single, independent property agent. It is not an open marketplace or a public brokerage platform. You agree that communication made through this site connects you directly with the property agent for the purposes of buying or leasing properties represented herein.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      Unless otherwise stated, Premier Properties and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on Premier Properties. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You may access this from Premier Properties for your own personal use subjected to restrictions set in these terms and conditions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      In no event shall Premier Properties or its agent be held liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on this website, even if notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
